# BlueShell active codebase

- **Repo root** is the **active codebase**. All new work and edits happen at the root.
- **V0/** is **legacy reference only**. Do not edit V0 or use it for codebase answers; it is preserved for reference.
- Design is **from-scratch** per the specification. See `docs/specification.md` and `docs/tasks.md`.

## Target layout (spec §11)

- **Entry point**: `src/BlueShell.psm1`
- **Script folders**: `src/bootstrap/`, `src/config/`, `src/env/`, `src/core/`
- **Tests**: `src/tests/` (structure mirrors src/ where relevant: tests/bootstrap/, tests/config/, tests/env/, tests/core/)
- **Docs**: `docs/` (specification.md, tasks.md, recommended-agent-skills.md)

Point agents at this new layout and at tests under `src/tests/`. Code must be cross-platform (PowerShell 7 on Windows, macOS, Linux); see spec §10 and AGENTS.md. Document any unavoidable platform differences (e.g. in install scripts or path handling).
